3. WHAT IS NOT COVERED — third-party books
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The directories

    Partition_Function_Study/Z_Ref_Books/
    Partition_Function_Study/Maths_Proof_Skill/

hold 31 reference books by other authors. They are present on the author's local
disk only. They are NOT part of this repository, are NOT distributed by it, and
are NOT licensed by either licence above. Each remains under its own publisher's
copyright.

.gitignore excludes them; `make check-no-books` fails the build if one is ever
staged. guidelines/BOOKSHELF_INVENTORY.md lists them with checksums so that a
reader who owns the same editions can verify they have the same files.
